OL,3,GNEWSARoadworks traffic jams causing
OL,4,Aschool run misery
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraffic jams caused by roadworks at a
OL,7,Fbusy Lincoln junction are adding more
OL,8,Fthan half an hour to the morning school
OL,9,Frun, local residents have said.
OL,11,FThe five-month long project to install
OL,12,Ftraffic lights at the Doddington Road
OL,13,Fand Birchwood Avenue junction began
OL,14,Fearlier this month.
OL,16,FThe upgrade is taking place to increase
OL,17,Froad capacity and reduce congestion,
OL,18,Fbut some drivers said it had caused
OL,19,F"non-stop traffic", adding 35 or 40
OL,20,Fminutes to their journeys to school.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
